    slug: "mobile-marketing-for-personal-injury-lawyers",
    title: "Mobile Marketing for Personal Injury Lawyers",
    metaTitle: "Mobile Marketing for Personal Injury Lawyers",
    metaDescription:
      "Why mobile marketing for personal injury lawyers matters, covering site speed, click-to-call ads, video, and Google Business optimization.",
